        "story_card_8fiye4": {
          "type": "story_card",
          "settings": {
            "customer_image": "shopify://shop_images/Clara.webp",
            "star_rating": 5,
            "quote": "Washes very well, lovely colour, very supportive! Absolutely love this bra, always reach for it whenever I have a training session. Great for running and strength training, Colour is so pretty and the rib detailing is really different to what I see from other brands.\n\nVery flexible and doesn't dig in at all and most importantly, washes extremely well. I have washed it about 10 times and it still looks like the day I bought it.\n\nLooking to get the plum one next time or the matching leggings!",
